rong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">저분자 히알루론산 1%</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">4.0g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">세정 중 피부 수분 손실 방지</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-teal-700 bg-teal-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[보존제]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">1,2-헥산다이올</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">1.5g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">저자극 방부 보존</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-purple-700 bg-purple-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[향료]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">알러지 프리 애플블라썸</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">1.0g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">상큼하고 싱그러운 청량감</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">제작 팁</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <